  "text": "About us\nProjects\nTeam\nCompetitions\nSponsor us\nJoin Marinor\nMARINOR NTNU · PROJECTS\nPick a project.\n\nRead about Argus, the boat we have built and tested, or Proteus, the boat we are designing now.\n\n2\nPROJECTS\n1\nON THE WATER\n1\nIN DEVELOPMENT\nON THE WATER\nArgus\n\nOur first autonomous boat. A catamaran with LiDAR, a stereo depth camera and a Kongsberg Seapath 130.\n\nCATAMARAN\nLIDAR\nSTEREO CAMERA\nSEAPATH 130\nExplore Argus\nPROTEUS · DRAFT\nREV 0.1\nIN DEVELOPMENT\nProteus\n\nOur next boat. We are working on the design now.\n\nCOMING SOON\nFollow Proteus\nFROM ONE BOAT TO THE NEXT\nEverything we learn on Argus goes into Proteus.\n2025\nMarinor is founded\n\nFour students start Marinor.\n\n2026\nArgus hits the water\n\nArgus goes in the water in Trondheim harbour.\n\n2026\nNjord Challenge\n\nWe enter the Njord Challenge with Argus.\n\nNext\nProteus\n\nOur next boat. Work has started.\n\nBE PART OF THE NEXT ONE\nWant to help build the next boat?\n\nJoin the team, or support us as a partner while we build Proteus.\n\nJoin Marinor\nBecome a partner\n\nA student organisation at NTNU in Trondheim that builds autonomous boats.\n\nmarinorntnu@gmail.com\nCopy\nHøgskoleringen 1\n7034 Trondheim\nInstagram\nLinkedIn\nMARINOR\nHome\nAbout us\nTeam\nCompetitions\nOUR WORK\nArgus\nProteus\nNjord Challenge\nRoboBoat\nGET INVOLVED\nJoin the crew\nSponsor us\nEmail us\n© 2026 Marinor NTNU\nOrg.nr. 936 064 809\nBack to top",
